  - name: NativeCompressions
    author: Cysharp
    category: 0
    licenseType: 0
    customLicenseText: 
    url: https://github.com/Cysharp/NativeCompressions
    usageDescription: High-performance native LZ4 bindings for Chunk Serialization.
    sourceFiles: []
    projectFiles: []
    version: 0.6.0
    notes: 
  - name: Starlight / ScalableLux
    author: RelativityMC
    category: 0
    licenseType: 4
    customLicenseText: 
    url: https://github.com/RelativityMC/ScalableLux
    usageDescription: Studied as a source of lighting optimization techniques - both
      its TECHNICAL_DETAILS.md write-up and the implementation behind it - after
      our own BFS flood-fill engine was already working.
    sourceFiles: []
    projectFiles: []
    version: 
    notes: Our light engine was built independently, then measured against Starlight
      to see which optimizations were worth adopting; the edge consistency check
      and the max(1, opacity) attenuation formula came from it. The shared BFS flood-fill
      core is convergence on the standard approach to voxel light propagation.
  - name: FastNoiseLite
    author: Auburn
