    - Assets/Audio/Blocks/nox_footsteps/
    version: 
    notes: '361 of the pack''s clips, all actively referenced, converted from 24-bit/48kHz
      WAV to OGG Vorbis. Mud_Walk was removed on 2026-08-31 - Dirt resolves to DirtyGround_Walk.
      Walk_Grass_Mono ships 35 of 50 and Grass_Run 14 of 15: the rest were auditioned
      out the same day as sounding like a leaf-strewn field rather than grass. The
      excluded variants are listed in nox_footsteps/.curated, which convert_audio_pack.py
      honours, so a re-import cannot recreate them. License stated in the pack''s
      Essentials_Series_README.pdf: ''All these sounds are under CC0 license.'''
  - name: Essentials Series (Nature)
    author: NOX_SOUND
    category: 6
    licenseType: 5
    customLicenseText: 
    url: https://www.asoundeffect.com/sounddesigner/nox-sound/
    usageDescription: Biome ambience beds, the underground cave bed, and the S3 water
