    - Assets/Audio/Emitters/nox_nature/
    version: 
    notes: '8 of the pack''s 18 loops, converted from 24-bit/48kHz stereo WAV to
      OGG Vorbis. The six beds stay stereo (2D sources); the two emitter loops are
      downmixed to mono, because a stereo clip does not spatialize on the 3D source
      an emitter plays from. Same Essentials Series README as the footsteps pack:
      ''All these sounds are under CC0 license.'''
